// The Carpenter powerup pickup model. Nuketown never had Carpenter, so its own zone has no copy
// and the powerup drew as an untextured slab once we added it to the drop pool.
xmodel,zombie_carpenter

// Perk bottle pool. Nuketown places no machine for any of these four, but enabling a perk
// precaches its machine models, bottle and shader regardless, so the assets still have to be
// here. Sourced from the Alcatraz, Die Rise and Transit zones that build.bat loads for this step.
weapon,zombie_perk_bottle_nuke
weapon,zombie_perk_bottle_deadshot
weapon,zombie_perk_bottle_marathon
weapon,zombie_perk_bottle_additionalprimaryweapon
